type: dataset
title: "Sealed Judge Enumeration Exhibit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Clouatre"
    given-names: "Hugues"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4291-1999"
repository-code: https://github.com/clouatre-labs/judge-enumeration-exhibit
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-10-11"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >
  Sealed n=5 exhibit comparing exact linear-programming vertex
  enumeration with typed probabilistic judge selections on a frozen
  blending problem. The feasible vertices, the preregistered question,
  and the sealed reading criterion are committed before any judge call.
keywords:
  - llm-agents
  - pre-registered-experiment
  - reproducibility
  - llm-evaluation
